          "en": "earlier in the course.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 63.66,
          "end": 65.67,
          "en": "And we could use techniques like this",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 65.67,
